<title>USA: Zygo Corp Q1 Sept 30 oper shr rises.</title>
<headline>Zygo Corp Q1 Sept 30 oper shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>MIDDLEFIELD, Conn. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.53		    $0.20</p>
<p> Oper net		    3,139			961</p>
<p> Net sales		  18,443		   11,831</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    5,930		    4,920</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Latest Q1 oper shr excludes non-recurring acquisition-related charges $11.1 million. Loss for first quarter after including charges was $7.9 million, or $1.55 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610</p>
